OL,3,GNEWSASome shoplift 'just for the
OL,4,Athrill', says officer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior police officer said
OL,7,Fshoplifting was a "tough nut to crack"
OL,8,Fand some people steal simply "for the
OL,9,Fthrill of it".
OL,11,F"People in well-paid, respectable jobs
OL,12,Fcome out in their lunch breaks and go
OL,13,Fand steal," said Det Insp Chris O'Brien
OL,14,Ffrom Cambridgeshire Police.
OL,16,FPolice data showed shoplifting had
OL,17,Fincreased by 51% across the county over
OL,18,Fthe past five years, although it fell
OL,19,Fby 6% in the last year.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
