OL,3,GNEWSASome shoplift 'just for the
OL,4,Athrill', says officer
OL,5,
OL,6,FAcross Cambridgeshire, some 7,161
OL,7,Fincidents were reported in 2025-26,
OL,8,Fwith Cambridge city centre identified
OL,9,Fas a hotspot. Half of shoplifting
OL,10,Finvestigations ended without a suspect
OL,11,Fbeing identified, the force said.
